(1295541, 167004, 22046, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh. Interesting choice for an item of shelter. Have you read "Life of Pi"? He used turtle shells for shelter from the sun.</td>', 'Made me laugh. Interesting choice for an item of shelter. Have you read "Life of Pi"? He used turtle shells for shelter from the sun.', '2005-04-16 03:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
