(1295543, 166795, 22046, '<td valign="top">Funny and clever.</td>', 'Funny and clever.', '2005-04-16 03:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295545, 166690, 22046, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. This one grew on me the more I looked at it. Very well done. Like the color and the lighting very much.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. This one grew on me the more I looked at it. Very well done. Like the color and the lighting very much.', '2005-04-16 03:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295565, 167057, 30861, '<td valign="top">This has GOT to ribbon. There''s not another image in this challenge that''s close to it. I just hope this ain''t Scalvert, ''cuz if it is he''s stuck in a rut of a magnitude equal to Zoomdak and his "damned beach", which is certain to make a reapperance in both Free Study and Rocks Scissors paper, IMO.<br/> <br/>jejeje<br/> <br/>Anyway, this is beautifully constructed and shot, whoever made it.</td>', 'This has GOT to ribbon. There''s not another image in this challenge that''s close to it. I just hope this ain''t Scalvert, ''cuz if it is he''s stuck in a rut of a magnitude equal to Zoomdak and his "damned beach", which is certain to make a reapperance in both Free Study and Rocks Scissors paper, IMO. jejeje Anyway, this is beautifully constructed and shot, whoever made it.', '2005-04-16 04:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295567, 167053, 30861, '<td valign="top">Another classic DPC theme reprised in "tacks"... I wish the tacks were sharper, though.</td>', 'Another classic DPC theme reprised in "tacks"... I wish the tacks were sharper, though.', '2005-04-16 04:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295572, 167023, 30861, '<td valign="top">Ther had to be a "splash" entry to round out the "classic themes" reprisal aspect of this challenge, and here it is. Nicely done, a littlke shy on the DOF. I love the way the slight arc of the tack''s point has created its own, mini-event down there.</td>', 'Ther had to be a "splash" entry to round out the "classic themes" reprisal aspect of this challenge, and here it is. Nicely done, a littlke shy on the DOF. I love the way the slight arc of the tack''s point has created its own, mini-event down there.', '2005-04-16 04:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295573, 166958, 30861, '<td valign="top">Conceptually, sharp as a tack. Technically, pretty blah to me.  BG is forgettable, and one would have liked to see lighting that enhanced the sense of sharpness on the razor''s edge.</td>', 'Conceptually, sharp as a tack. Technically, pretty blah to me.  BG is forgettable, and one would have liked to see lighting that enhanced the sense of sharpness on the razor''s edge.', '2005-04-16 04:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295576, 166681, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very clean &amp; interesting, compositionally. I''m a little bothered by the dark fringing where red overlaps blue. Strong entry.</td>', 'Very clean & interesting, compositionally. I''m a little bothered by the dark fringing where red overlaps blue. Strong entry.', '2005-04-16 04:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295578, 166964, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully orginal both conceptually and compositionally. Takes a veryhigh score from me, I hope others are open enough in their thinking to accept all that negative space for what it is and what it does to the gravitas of the image.</td>', 'Wonderfully orginal both conceptually and compositionally. Takes a veryhigh score from me, I hope others are open enough in their thinking to accept all that negative space for what it is and what it does to the gravitas of the image.', '2005-04-16 04:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295580, 166957, 30861, '<td valign="top">The best "horde of tacks" in the challenge. High points for patience in setting this up. How long did it take you anyway?  The lighting seems alittle bland. Strong entry.</td>', 'The best "horde of tacks" in the challenge. High points for patience in setting this up. How long did it take you anyway?  The lighting seems alittle bland. Strong entry.', '2005-04-16 04:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295584, 166713, 30861, '<td valign="top">There''s a wonderful purity to this, but I wish it were truly squared up; that seems to me vital to the concept. Strong "minimalist" entry.</td>', 'There''s a wonderful purity to this, but I wish it were truly squared up; that seems to me vital to the concept. Strong "minimalist" entry.', '2005-04-16 04:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295586, 166965, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like the quiet abstraction of this. A very appeaking entry. I particularly liek the precise way the curve of the left  tack is tangent to the edge of the paper. Was this a happy accident or soemthign you worked at?</td>', 'I like the quiet abstraction of this. A very appeaking entry. I particularly liek the precise way the curve of the left  tack is tangent to the edge of the paper. Was this a happy accident or soemthign you worked at?', '2005-04-16 04:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295587, 166812, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is hysterical. High points for both originality and bravery in entering this. I wish you well!</td>', 'This is hysterical. High points for both originality and bravery in entering this. I wish you well!', '2005-04-16 04:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295590, 166824, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m quite taken by this low-key and totally sideways approach to the challenge. Virtually everyoen else is focusing on the "pointiness" of their tacks, here we see them as retainers or delimiters, not penetrators. I hope this does well.</td>', 'I''m quite taken by this low-key and totally sideways approach to the challenge. Virtually everyoen else is focusing on the "pointiness" of their tacks, here we see them as retainers or delimiters, not penetrators. I hope this does well.', '2005-04-16 04:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295593, 166970, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very strange image. I''m almost convinced you actyally drew blood to make this shot. And the SHAPE of the fleshhere is so ODD. It makes me think "cobra", and it makes me think "turd"... I''m sure you''re cracking up by now. I''m scoring you right up there just for shock value alone. Feel free to PM me and let me know if this comment cracks you up as much as the image did me.</td>', 'Very strange image. I''m almost convinced you actyally drew blood to make this shot. And the SHAPE of the fleshhere is so ODD. It makes me think "cobra", and it makes me think "turd"... I''m sure you''re cracking up by now. I''m scoring you right up there just for shock value alone. Feel free to PM me and let me know if this comment cracks you up as much as the image did me.', '2005-04-16 04:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
