(1295634, 166932, 20124, '<td valign="top"><br/> <br/>Clever play with words.  Even better however would have been to show two tacks<br/>in the pic as tacks sounds exactly like tax.</td>', ' Clever play with words.  Even better however would have been to show two tacksin the pic as tacks sounds exactly like tax.', '2005-04-16 05:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
