(1295643, 167021, 20124, '<td valign="top">Well at least you can reuse this pic on the next nude challenge.<br/>This seems a bit overexposed and I don''t mean just the nudity.<br/>The lighting is glaring. <br/>    However I do like youroriginal  idea on the tack theme.</td>', 'Well at least you can reuse this pic on the next nude challenge.This seems a bit overexposed and I don''t mean just the nudity.The lighting is glaring.     However I do like youroriginal  idea on the tack theme.', '2005-04-16 05:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295645, 167053, 30712, '<td valign="top">A lovely combination of shapes and colours.  It makes an ordinary object look special.</td>', 'A lovely combination of shapes and colours.  It makes an ordinary object look special.', '2005-04-16 05:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295647, 166957, 30712, '<td valign="top">A truly sensational interpretation.  The curves of colour shout ''Look!''</td>', 'A truly sensational interpretation.  The curves of colour shout ''Look!''', '2005-04-16 05:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295648, 166851, 30712, '<td valign="top">The lighting effects here are simple but so effective.  A powerful image.</td>', 'The lighting effects here are simple but so effective.  A powerful image.', '2005-04-16 05:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295649, 167027, 30712, '<td valign="top">A clever idea that works so well.  I''m not sure about the orange background but I''m sure that others wouldn''t be so fussy.</td>', 'A clever idea that works so well.  I''m not sure about the orange background but I''m sure that others wouldn''t be so fussy.', '2005-04-16 05:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295650, 166908, 33560, '<td valign="top">The compositon is a little static. Some of the tacks look out of focus.  And there seems to be a lot of noise in the background.  I think if the scene had stronger lighting two of these things could have been improved simultaneously.</td>', 'The compositon is a little static. Some of the tacks look out of focus.  And there seems to be a lot of noise in the background.  I think if the scene had stronger lighting two of these things could have been improved simultaneously.', '2005-04-16 05:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295651, 167029, 20124, '<td valign="top">You will get a ribbon for this I  predict.  Well done!</td>', 'You will get a ribbon for this I  predict.  Well done!', '2005-04-16 05:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295653, 167038, 30712, '<td valign="top">Great lighting effects make for an eyecatching image.  The upward pointing spikes give these small items an appearance of being large and powerful.</td>', 'Great lighting effects make for an eyecatching image.  The upward pointing spikes give these small items an appearance of being large and powerful.', '2005-04-16 05:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295654, 166691, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like the compositon of the photo. Although some of the blurrines helps the photo, I wish more of it were in focus.  Had I not read the thread on tacks yesterday, I''d probably not realize that the reins that control a horse - to which this camera strap alludes - are referred to as tack.    And I think collectively all the reins in the world are referred to as ''tack'' not ''tacks.''  But I''m inclined to give as many points for thinking outside the box and presenting an offbeat image as I''d be to deduct for not meeting the challenge.</td>', 'I like the compositon of the photo. Although some of the blurrines helps the photo, I wish more of it were in focus.  Had I not read the thread on tacks yesterday, I''d probably not realize that the reins that control a horse - to which this camera strap alludes - are referred to as tack.    And I think collectively all the reins in the world are referred to as ''tack'' not ''tacks.''  But I''m inclined to give as many points for thinking outside the box and presenting an offbeat image as I''d be to deduct for not meeting the challenge.', '2005-04-16 05:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295655, 166763, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great Idea,  is the answer 1   or is it 42<br/>My son came up with the following solution for this problem<br/>take 1 from each of the odd numbers and then add the results. ( so there is a mathematical solution) <br/>It took him much longer when I told him to find a solution sugested in the title....<br/> <br/>Anyhoo   I like this...</td>', 'Great Idea,  is the answer 1   or is it 42My son came up with the following solution for this problemtake 1 from each of the odd numbers and then add the results. ( so there is a mathematical solution) It took him much longer when I told him to find a solution sugested in the title.... Anyhoo   I like this...', '2005-04-16 05:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295657, 166746, 33352, '<td valign="top">very Well Done</td>', 'very Well Done', '2005-04-16 05:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295658, 167004, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very funny.  Very strong idea.<br/> <br/>It should be a quibble, but for some reason it strikes me as a major issue:  The sepias and blacks of the shell and background are so strong that they make me want to see colors from the same palette - secondary or tertiary colors all  a little warm and unsaturated.  Not sure whether clear and/or chrome tacks would work.  Or if the choice of background limits the choice down to ''brass tacks.''</td>', 'Very funny.  Very strong idea. It should be a quibble, but for some reason it strikes me as a major issue:  The sepias and blacks of the shell and background are so strong that they make me want to see colors from the same palette - secondary or tertiary colors all  a little warm and unsaturated.  Not sure whether clear and/or chrome tacks would work.  Or if the choice of background limits the choice down to ''brass tacks.''', '2005-04-16 05:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295659, 167043, 33560, '<td valign="top">This photo has such a strong greenish tint that  I almost cannot view it.  The ''naturalistic'' take on tacks is refreshing.  I like the depth of field.  I find the photo a little cluttered.</td>', 'This photo has such a strong greenish tint that  I almost cannot view it.  The ''naturalistic'' take on tacks is refreshing.  I like the depth of field.  I find the photo a little cluttered.', '2005-04-16 05:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295660, 167030, 33560, '<td valign="top">There is something about the interaction between the clear tacks, the light, and the lens that has rendered a strange purple glow on the left edge of each tack.  I imagine that if it were very much more prominent we could accept it as a feature, but in its current configuration it strikes one as a serious lens problem.  I like the choice of color palette and materials for the photo, but find the composition a little static.</td>', 'There is something about the interaction between the clear tacks, the light, and the lens that has rendered a strange purple glow on the left edge of each tack.  I imagine that if it were very much more prominent we could accept it as a feature, but in its current configuration it strikes one as a serious lens problem.  I like the choice of color palette and materials for the photo, but find the composition a little static.', '2005-04-16 06:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295663, 166713, 33352, '<td valign="top">Nicley done</td>', 'Nicley done', '2005-04-16 06:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295665, 167037, 30712, '<td valign="top">What an extraordinary idea!  I like it.  Very well executed.</td>', 'What an extraordinary idea!  I like it.  Very well executed.', '2005-04-16 06:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295666, 166963, 32345, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then casjavascript: do_vote(4)<br/> 4 t your vote...</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then casjavascript: do_vote(4) 4 t your vote...', '2005-04-16 06:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295667, 167023, 30712, '<td valign="top">It''s one thing having the idea and another making it work as well as this.  I love the lighting.</td>', 'It''s one thing having the idea and another making it work as well as this.  I love the lighting.', '2005-04-16 06:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295668, 166947, 33560, '<td valign="top">An unusual tack.   I love the idea.  I very much like the choice of colors and the lighting.  The positioning of the yellow tack and the protruding point both seem good.  And so does the lighting.I don''t quite understand what it is, but someting is bothering me about the photo and it has something to do with visual clutter: the bubble like features on the top surface or the lumps on the side, or just the fact that the subject tack is being upstaged by the yellow one.   Can''t identify the exact cause, just the effect.</td>', 'An unusual tack.   I love the idea.  I very much like the choice of colors and the lighting.  The positioning of the yellow tack and the protruding point both seem good.  And so does the lighting.I don''t quite understand what it is, but someting is bothering me about the photo and it has something to do with visual clutter: the bubble like features on the top surface or the lumps on the side, or just the fact that the subject tack is being upstaged by the yellow one.   Can''t identify the exact cause, just the effect.', '2005-04-16 06:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295670, 167057, 30712, '<td valign="top">This image has atmoshere even if the planet hasn''t.  Very powerful and other-worldly.</td>', 'This image has atmoshere even if the planet hasn''t.  Very powerful and other-worldly.', '2005-04-16 06:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295671, 166901, 30712, '<td valign="top">So simple yet often these are the images that say the most.</td>', 'So simple yet often these are the images that say the most.', '2005-04-16 06:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295673, 166690, 30712, '<td valign="top">An atmospheric shot with interesting lighting.  The indistinct out of focus areas give an air of mystery.</td>', 'An atmospheric shot with interesting lighting.  The indistinct out of focus areas give an air of mystery.', '2005-04-16 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295674, 166987, 30712, '<td valign="top">Monochrome working well here.  The raindrop rings make the shot.</td>', 'Monochrome working well here.  The raindrop rings make the shot.', '2005-04-16 06:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295678, 167031, 30712, '<td valign="top">A great idea to make this an underwater scene.  The limited depth of field adds to feeling of looking into the image from a distance.</td>', 'A great idea to make this an underwater scene.  The limited depth of field adds to feeling of looking into the image from a distance.', '2005-04-16 06:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295680, 166882, 33352, '<td valign="top">Very Clever</td>', 'Very Clever', '2005-04-16 06:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295681, 166851, 33560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful choice of colors &amp; lighting angles.  Nice rhythm set by tacks. I have the impression that the pink light areas have blown highlights because there seems to be great loss of detail.  Similarly, the shadows seem a little strong on the some blue tacks.  Some of this effect may have been purposeful, but  I''d be happier to see a bit less of it.</td>', 'Beautiful choice of colors & lighting angles.  Nice rhythm set by tacks. I have the impression that the pink light areas have blown highlights because there seems to be great loss of detail.  Similarly, the shadows seem a little strong on the some blue tacks.  Some of this effect may have been purposeful, but  I''d be happier to see a bit less of it.', '2005-04-16 06:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295682, 167019, 327, '<td valign="top">very creative!</td>', 'very creative!', '2005-04-16 06:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295684, 167029, 327, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2005-04-16 06:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295685, 166747, 31794, '<td valign="top">that´s just evil, to to something like this to DaVici´s most famous piece of work..</td>', 'that´s just evil, to to something like this to DaVici´s most famous piece of work..', '2005-04-16 06:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295686, 166991, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very strong image.  I like the simle background, the lighting, the colors, and the fact that the strongest texture in the thumb (or finger) is in focus.  I would be a little happier with the image if the focus on the tack were similarly tack sharp.  I suppose some of the softness the tack appears to have may be from translucence or reflective surfaces, but its top and left edges do  not look sharp.  Probably easy to fix using sharpening software.</td>', 'Very strong image.  I like the simle background, the lighting, the colors, and the fact that the strongest texture in the thumb (or finger) is in focus.  I would be a little happier with the image if the focus on the tack were similarly tack sharp.  I suppose some of the softness the tack appears to have may be from translucence or reflective surfaces, but its top and left edges do  not look sharp.  Probably easy to fix using sharpening software.', '2005-04-16 06:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295687, 166752, 33560, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit more like  ''huddled masses.''  I''m afraid the central grouping doesn''t work for me.  The greenish or cyan reflections strike me as a little wierd.  I know my morning vision is a little blurry, but this photo seems less sharp to me than several of the ones I''ve recently viewed.</td>', 'Seems a bit more like  ''huddled masses.''  I''m afraid the central grouping doesn''t work for me.  The greenish or cyan reflections strike me as a little wierd.  I know my morning vision is a little blurry, but this photo seems less sharp to me than several of the ones I''ve recently viewed.', '2005-04-16 06:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295688, 166857, 31794, '<td valign="top">if the tacks woul only be on one side of the picture it would look better, this has too much symmetry.</td>', 'if the tacks woul only be on one side of the picture it would look better, this has too much symmetry.', '2005-04-16 06:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295690, 166882, 33560, '<td valign="top">Strong image.</td>', 'Strong image.', '2005-04-16 06:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295691, 166939, 31794, '<td valign="top">the fake blood is really badly painted in, should use strawberry icecream sauce or something like that :)</td>', 'the fake blood is really badly painted in, should use strawberry icecream sauce or something like that :)', '2005-04-16 06:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295692, 166919, 33560, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image. I love the fact that it tells a story, one of our relationship to tacks ( and metaphorically to tax.)  I love the lighting and the composition.  I love the way we see the texture of the skin, the floor, and the tack; and the way all else is is blurred.  Placing of the curtain in the photo is perfect.  This strikes me as masterful work in every way.  Bravo.</td>', 'A beautiful image. I love the fact that it tells a story, one of our relationship to tacks ( and metaphorically to tax.)  I love the lighting and the composition.  I love the way we see the texture of the skin, the floor, and the tack; and the way all else is is blurred.  Placing of the curtain in the photo is perfect.  This strikes me as masterful work in every way.  Bravo.', '2005-04-16 06:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295694, 166997, 33560, '<td valign="top">Goodbye subtlty.  Goodbye good humor.  Goodbye civility.  Goodbye tolerance.  Goodbye civilization.<br/> <br/>Okay, okay, I will assume it''s meant to be funny.  But if I were a punster I could easily find it offensive and small minded.  <br/> <br/>I''m afraid I''m having a hard time finding anything good to say about the photo except ''good job in avoiding blown highlights.''</td>', 'Goodbye subtlty.  Goodbye good humor.  Goodbye civility.  Goodbye tolerance.  Goodbye civilization. Okay, okay, I will assume it''s meant to be funny.  But if I were a punster I could easily find it offensive and small minded.   I''m afraid I''m having a hard time finding anything good to say about the photo except ''good job in avoiding blown highlights.''', '2005-04-16 06:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295695, 167061, 9668, '<td valign="top">Battle of the Bulge you mean? No, just kidding around :). Ketchup, flags, and a battle, interesting idea. Backdrop is visible.</td>', 'Battle of the Bulge you mean? No, just kidding around :). Ketchup, flags, and a battle, interesting idea. Backdrop is visible.', '2005-04-16 06:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
