(1295697, 167006, 32749, '<td valign="top">First Rule of fight tack...........<br/> <br/>Good idea and composition, I think you needed to have sharp focus on the fighters, they look just out.</td>', 'First Rule of fight tack........... Good idea and composition, I think you needed to have sharp focus on the fighters, they look just out.', '2005-04-16 06:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295698, 166840, 9668, '<td valign="top">I applaud you being able to find all thos past years forms. Interesting combination.</td>', 'I applaud you being able to find all thos past years forms. Interesting combination.', '2005-04-16 06:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295700, 166870, 19952, '<td valign="top">As I''m sure everyone will tell you, this image is over-sharpened, but it''s a really cool shot nonetheless. Nice point of focus (har!) and really good setup. Very well done.</td>', 'As I''m sure everyone will tell you, this image is over-sharpened, but it''s a really cool shot nonetheless. Nice point of focus (har!) and really good setup. Very well done.', '2005-04-16 06:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295701, 166911, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting! I''d love to find out how you set this up.</td>', 'Nice lighting! I''d love to find out how you set this up.', '2005-04-16 06:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295702, 167023, 33560, '<td valign="top">The fluid, glass, and background are ideally realized.   I wonder if you considered using a clear or shiny metallic tack.  Perhaps that would make the photo a little more confusing, but the muddy red color of this tack strikes me as being completely inconsistent with the visual qualities of the rest of the photo.  I know it should be a quibble, but the tack is the ''focal point'' of the photo and if it is not pretty, it''s like a long joke with no</td>', 'The fluid, glass, and background are ideally realized.   I wonder if you considered using a clear or shiny metallic tack.  Perhaps that would make the photo a little more confusing, but the muddy red color of this tack strikes me as being completely inconsistent with the visual qualities of the rest of the photo.  I know it should be a quibble, but the tack is the ''focal point'' of the photo and if it is not pretty, it''s like a long joke with no', '2005-04-16 06:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295703, 167064, 9668, '<td valign="top">Woohoo! My shot is in there =). Firefox, good stuff. Lots of tabs! MSN, Gmail, Ebay, Amazon, Dell, and many others, wow. Awsome idea, I''d like to see how you did it (my guess is it is a normal piece of glass over the monitor).</td>', 'Woohoo! My shot is in there =). Firefox, good stuff. Lots of tabs! MSN, Gmail, Ebay, Amazon, Dell, and many others, wow. Awsome idea, I''d like to see how you did it (my guess is it is a normal piece of glass over the monitor).', '2005-04-16 06:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295704, 166858, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love puns, so how could I not love this photo?</td>', 'I love puns, so how could I not love this photo?', '2005-04-16 06:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295705, 166997, 19952, '<td valign="top">LOL - funny shot! Actually, the contrast is abit low on this image. The lightest and darkest points are still shades of grey. Maybe you can set the writing as your black point and the lightest piece of paper as your white point, then the image''s color will look richer. Still, nice setup. Thanks for the laugh!</td>', 'LOL - funny shot! Actually, the contrast is abit low on this image. The lightest and darkest points are still shades of grey. Maybe you can set the writing as your black point and the lightest piece of paper as your white point, then the image''s color will look richer. Still, nice setup. Thanks for the laugh!', '2005-04-16 06:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295706, 166901, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice treatment.</td>', 'Nice treatment.', '2005-04-16 06:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295708, 166957, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice setup! The colors seem just a little dim, so they might could use a boost in overall image contrast. But still, this is an outstanding image and a really nice concept for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice setup! The colors seem just a little dim, so they might could use a boost in overall image contrast. But still, this is an outstanding image and a really nice concept for this challenge.', '2005-04-16 06:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295709, 167023, 36060, '<td valign="top">I think this is a cracker!</td>', 'I think this is a cracker!', '2005-04-16 06:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295710, 166964, 19952, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this shot. The quality of light and focus in this shot is absolutely professional. Sure the concept is weird &lt;g&gt;, but the shot is really nicely done. :-)</td>', 'I love the lighting in this shot. The quality of light and focus in this shot is absolutely professional. Sure the concept is weird <g>, but the shot is really nicely done. :-)', '2005-04-16 06:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295711, 166870, 33560, '<td valign="top">Boy am I scared!  Cute idea.  Nicely framed.  Good choice of bright light, short focal length lens. Although the dog''s face more than fills the frame, I am left with a sense of emptiness here.  Somehow the dog - in his choice of expression - has subverted the photographer''s intent and has become the background, and suddenly the tack is too small.  That''s just what I see.</td>', 'Boy am I scared!  Cute idea.  Nicely framed.  Good choice of bright light, short focal length lens. Although the dog''s face more than fills the frame, I am left with a sense of emptiness here.  Somehow the dog - in his choice of expression - has subverted the photographer''s intent and has become the background, and suddenly the tack is too small.  That''s just what I see.', '2005-04-16 06:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295712, 167022, 19952, '<td valign="top">Too funny! This is a really nice setup with excellent lighting and color. Very well done!</td>', 'Too funny! This is a really nice setup with excellent lighting and color. Very well done!', '2005-04-16 06:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295714, 167063, 19952, '<td valign="top"></td>', '', '2005-04-16 06:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
