(1295720, 167023, 14614, '<td valign="top">really like the bold color and great timing.</td>', 'really like the bold color and great timing.', '2005-04-16 07:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295721, 166713, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very cool setup and nice lighting.</td>', 'Very cool setup and nice lighting.', '2005-04-16 07:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295722, 166729, 33560, '<td valign="top">Intersting.  I''m wowed at the inclusion of that big white shaggy blanket thing which fills almost half the frame.  It somehow MAKES the photo; although after considerable reflection, I''m not clear about its connection to the tacks.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Intersting.  I''m wowed at the inclusion of that big white shaggy blanket thing which fills almost half the frame.  It somehow MAKES the photo; although after considerable reflection, I''m not clear about its connection to the tacks.  Nice shot.', '2005-04-16 07:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295724, 167007, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the eery shadows.  Nice work!</td>', 'Love the eery shadows.  Nice work!', '2005-04-16 07:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295725, 166751, 33560, '<td valign="top">Woody abuse! Woody abuse!   The color palette works nicely.  And it''s a nice take on the theme.</td>', 'Woody abuse! Woody abuse!   The color palette works nicely.  And it''s a nice take on the theme.', '2005-04-16 07:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295726, 167060, 33560, '<td valign="top">Are we to conclude that this tack is feeling blue because it is all alone?  It strikes me as a beautiful shot visually.  And the fact that it works in a metaphorical way makes it much stronger.</td>', 'Are we to conclude that this tack is feeling blue because it is all alone?  It strikes me as a beautiful shot visually.  And the fact that it works in a metaphorical way makes it much stronger.', '2005-04-16 07:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295732, 166970, 35229, '<td valign="top">Why??</td>', 'Why??', '2005-04-16 07:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295734, 166937, 35229, '<td valign="top">Not so centered it would be good.</td>', 'Not so centered it would be good.', '2005-04-16 07:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295740, 167053, 33560, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it was a choice to use warm light for this shot, but I wonder whether it makes things look muddy in a way that detracts from the photo?  The golden and red pins probably are improved by the look.  The green and violet pins take on a  moody smoky look which is interesting.  I think it is the muddiness of the dark shadows that bother me most, and the odd color of the background highlights.  ...  Okay, after photoshopping the incandescent light out of it I realize that I''m no happier with the photo.  I really love its colorful transparent elements individually, but there is something about the composition that still bothers me.</td>', 'Perhaps it was a choice to use warm light for this shot, but I wonder whether it makes things look muddy in a way that detracts from the photo?  The golden and red pins probably are improved by the look.  The green and violet pins take on a  moody smoky look which is interesting.  I think it is the muddiness of the dark shadows that bother me most, and the odd color of the background highlights.  ...  Okay, after photoshopping the incandescent light out of it I realize that I''m no happier with the photo.  I really love its colorful transparent elements individually, but there is something about the composition that still bothers me.', '2005-04-16 07:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295744, 167056, 33560, '<td valign="top">I find all the transparent pins - especially the out-of-focus pins - to be quite beautiful.  While I am usually bowled over by yellow and red used together tastefully - as they are here, I find myself wondering whether the photo would not be much more visually appealing if all the tacks were transparent.  I understand it would mean losing one layer of meaning from the title, but I think it might be worth it.</td>', 'I find all the transparent pins - especially the out-of-focus pins - to be quite beautiful.  While I am usually bowled over by yellow and red used together tastefully - as they are here, I find myself wondering whether the photo would not be much more visually appealing if all the tacks were transparent.  I understand it would mean losing one layer of meaning from the title, but I think it might be worth it.', '2005-04-16 07:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295746, 166737, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s like a charred forest in winter.  Very nice.</td>', 'It''s like a charred forest in winter.  Very nice.', '2005-04-16 07:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295749, 166906, 33560, '<td valign="top">Great choice of background!</td>', 'Great choice of background!', '2005-04-16 07:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295750, 166881, 33560, '<td valign="top">Took a while; guess I don''t spend enough time in pubs.  Very nice.</td>', 'Took a while; guess I don''t spend enough time in pubs.  Very nice.', '2005-04-16 07:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295755, 167029, 33560, '<td valign="top">Off to impale some olives!   Very scary.</td>', 'Off to impale some olives!   Very scary.', '2005-04-16 07:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295756, 166938, 33560, '<td valign="top">Ha!  subversive, fun, and nicely shot.</td>', 'Ha!  subversive, fun, and nicely shot.', '2005-04-16 07:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295759, 166925, 33560, '<td valign="top">''Simplify, Simplify, Simplify.''   -  Thoureau.<br/> <br/>I think if he''d have really meant it he''d have said it just once.   I really like this photo!  It strikes the perfect balance between stark simplicity, baroque order, and chaos.  Very Nice.</td>', '''Simplify, Simplify, Simplify.''   -  Thoureau. I think if he''d have really meant it he''d have said it just once.   I really like this photo!  It strikes the perfect balance between stark simplicity, baroque order, and chaos.  Very Nice.', '2005-04-16 07:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295763, 166741, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the creative take on the challenge.  Great color in the boat -- only suggestion is a bit less color in the water as it competes with the boat''s color so neither stands out. (just my opinion, of course)</td>', 'I like the creative take on the challenge.  Great color in the boat -- only suggestion is a bit less color in the water as it competes with the boat''s color so neither stands out. (just my opinion, of course)', '2005-04-16 07:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295765, 166814, 14614, '<td valign="top">like the gray and white treatment... the blurry end in the lower left/center detracts as it pulls my eye to a less important spot in the photo... otherwise you did a good job with the busy composition</td>', 'like the gray and white treatment... the blurry end in the lower left/center detracts as it pulls my eye to a less important spot in the photo... otherwise you did a good job with the busy composition', '2005-04-16 07:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295772, 166989, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the background.  I like the fact that the clothing and even the hair blends well with the background.  The completely arbitrary juxtaposition of the face with everything else boarders on the surreal without tapping into the subconscious.  As a fan of the unusual and a person  usually comfortable with the bizarre, I''m having a hard time liking this photo.  It occurs to me that the pinkess of the face and the primary colors of the tacks individually and jointly clash with all the other color elements. And even though the shot of the background is dynamic, the framing of the subject is so static that it cancels out any advantages the background might have brought to the photo.  Just my opinion, though.</td>', 'I love the background.  I like the fact that the clothing and even the hair blends well with the background.  The completely arbitrary juxtaposition of the face with everything else boarders on the surreal without tapping into the subconscious.  As a fan of the unusual and a person  usually comfortable with the bizarre, I''m having a hard time liking this photo.  It occurs to me that the pinkess of the face and the primary colors of the tacks individually and jointly clash with all the other color elements. And even though the shot of the background is dynamic, the framing of the subject is so static that it cancels out any advantages the background might have brought to the photo.  Just my opinion, though.', '2005-04-16 07:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295775, 166965, 33560, '<td valign="top">Elegant.</td>', 'Elegant.', '2005-04-16 07:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295777, 167024, 33560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2005-04-16 07:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295782, 166939, 33560, '<td valign="top">The suggestion of gore almost always strikes this voter as being both unnecessary and unpleasant.  It''s not that I just like shiny, happy photos.  Just the opposite.  I often prefer dark and brooding ones.  But in photos and films, I think we find threats are always more scary than actualities.  <br/> <br/>It''s curious, in this case I find the red stuff simultaneously grotesque and unconvincing.  I wish the whole thumb were in focus.  I wish the warm color of the incandescent light had been corrected.  And I find the composition  a little static for my tastes.</td>', 'The suggestion of gore almost always strikes this voter as being both unnecessary and unpleasant.  It''s not that I just like shiny, happy photos.  Just the opposite.  I often prefer dark and brooding ones.  But in photos and films, I think we find threats are always more scary than actualities.   It''s curious, in this case I find the red stuff simultaneously grotesque and unconvincing.  I wish the whole thumb were in focus.  I wish the warm color of the incandescent light had been corrected.  And I find the composition  a little static for my tastes.', '2005-04-16 08:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295783, 167019, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very creative composition. The lighting and setup are also well done. This is quite an interesting image and certainly my favorite to win the blue. Great job to come up with this on a 24 hour challenge.</td>', 'Very creative composition. The lighting and setup are also well done. This is quite an interesting image and certainly my favorite to win the blue. Great job to come up with this on a 24 hour challenge.', '2005-04-16 08:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295784, 166815, 33560, '<td valign="top">''Tacks for the memories ...''  Isn''t that how the tune goes?  Or do we not remember Bob Hope?  I appreciate that the colors all work well together.  I like the use depth of field.</td>', '''Tacks for the memories ...''  Isn''t that how the tune goes?  Or do we not remember Bob Hope?  I appreciate that the colors all work well together.  I like the use depth of field.', '2005-04-16 08:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295785, 166958, 3306, '<td valign="top">Creative and well executed. The focus is dead on and the lighting works well.  An interesting concept. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Creative and well executed. The focus is dead on and the lighting works well.  An interesting concept. One of my favorites.', '2005-04-16 08:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
