(1295792, 166741, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken colorful and different representation of tacks. Its a nice change! I was getting a little "stuck" on which of the other pictures were my favorites, but this one is right up there!! Great job.</td>', 'Nicely taken colorful and different representation of tacks. Its a nice change! I was getting a little "stuck" on which of the other pictures were my favorites, but this one is right up there!! Great job.', '2005-04-16 08:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
