(1295800, 167061, 33560, '<td valign="top">The battle of rumper hill?  The idea seems funny.  I find the gore to be unecessary and distracting.</td>', 'The battle of rumper hill?  The idea seems funny.  I find the gore to be unecessary and distracting.', '2005-04-16 08:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
