(1296150, 167053, 34192, '<td valign="top">There are no tacks in this image. ;)  The color and focus are a little off but the concept is good.  Think a white background would have worked better. 6 for the originality</td>', 'There are no tacks in this image. ;)  The color and focus are a little off but the concept is good.  Think a white background would have worked better. 6 for the originality', '2005-04-16 11:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
