(1296178, 166962, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but the wierd purple haze/loss of contrast that is dominant in the lower part of the image kindof ruins it for me personally, is this flare or what is going on?  Anyway, trying to look past that this image would have potentially been a 7-8 from me due to the fact that I love the colour and contrast of the top half of the image but as it is now I can´t really give it anything but a 5.</td>', 'Nice shot but the wierd purple haze/loss of contrast that is dominant in the lower part of the image kindof ruins it for me personally, is this flare or what is going on?  Anyway, trying to look past that this image would have potentially been a 7-8 from me due to the fact that I love the colour and contrast of the top half of the image but as it is now I can´t really give it anything but a 5.', '2005-04-16 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296180, 166934, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love this.  There is something obscene about it.  But there are no tacks in the image. ;)  I really like the way the background is not COMPLETELY black like many images are - that takes away all the texture and a lot of the depth.  your focus is good and don''t mind the pear being the center of the image.  8 for capturing my attention.</td>', 'Love this.  There is something obscene about it.  But there are no tacks in the image. ;)  I really like the way the background is not COMPLETELY black like many images are - that takes away all the texture and a lot of the depth.  your focus is good and don''t mind the pear being the center of the image.  8 for capturing my attention.', '2005-04-16 12:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296183, 167038, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Yes it is.  Too bad there are no tacks in the image. ;)  Its a little out of focus but I like the way it makes the background look. 7 for the colors.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Yes it is.  Too bad there are no tacks in the image. ;)  Its a little out of focus but I like the way it makes the background look. 7 for the colors.', '2005-04-16 12:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296184, 167029, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hee-hee-hee!  He looks so mad!!!  To bad there are no tacks in the image. ;)  9 for the creativity and time spent. DOF and color works well with this image.</td>', 'Hee-hee-hee!  He looks so mad!!!  To bad there are no tacks in the image. ;)  9 for the creativity and time spent. DOF and color works well with this image.', '2005-04-16 12:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296186, 166763, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very good!  And you used real tacks!  Great job with a new use for tacks! 9 for creativity.  Wish the white outside the boxes wasn''t white.  DOF excellent. for this image.</td>', 'Very good!  And you used real tacks!  Great job with a new use for tacks! 9 for creativity.  Wish the white outside the boxes wasn''t white.  DOF excellent. for this image.', '2005-04-16 12:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296187, 166803, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like this image, excellent colours and DOF but for my personal taste it could have had a little bit more contrast and I would have framed it so that the tack was a little bit more up in the left corner as per the rule of thirds but this is just nitpicking.  I gave it an 8 and hope you do well.</td>', 'I like this image, excellent colours and DOF but for my personal taste it could have had a little bit more contrast and I would have framed it so that the tack was a little bit more up in the left corner as per the rule of thirds but this is just nitpicking.  I gave it an 8 and hope you do well.', '2005-04-16 12:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296190, 167045, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very original use of tacks!  With the addition of pushpins too!  I really think the holes are too close together - you really wouldn''t see that in real world situations.  The lighting is a tad harsh and the DOF could be a little larger.  Overall, very interesting image.  7 for having so much time on your hands and a creative mind.</td>', 'Very original use of tacks!  With the addition of pushpins too!  I really think the holes are too close together - you really wouldn''t see that in real world situations.  The lighting is a tad harsh and the DOF could be a little larger.  Overall, very interesting image.  7 for having so much time on your hands and a creative mind.', '2005-04-16 12:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296191, 166824, 24951, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful and serene. (and different)10</td>', 'Very beautiful and serene. (and different)10', '2005-04-16 12:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296192, 167023, 27482, '<td valign="top">Finally!  An image that stands out from the rest of the challenge.  No offense to anyone really but this challenge IMO has been terrible so far and I don´t think I have ever given out so many scores of 5 or lower.  Anyway, love pretty much everything about this shot except that maybe the DOF could have been bigger to include the drops in the backround that fade out but this is just nitpicking.  The first 10 I gave this challenge, hope you do well.</td>', 'Finally!  An image that stands out from the rest of the challenge.  No offense to anyone really but this challenge IMO has been terrible so far and I don´t think I have ever given out so many scores of 5 or lower.  Anyway, love pretty much everything about this shot except that maybe the DOF could have been bigger to include the drops in the backround that fade out but this is just nitpicking.  The first 10 I gave this challenge, hope you do well.', '2005-04-16 12:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296195, 166954, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hope you don´t get voted down from people that only think of tacks as being those little pointy things but my guess is you aren´t doing to well because of narrow minded people.  Anyway, good shot but not exceptional either, needs something to make it go "wow" like a dramatic sunset in the clould or something. It could also use a little bit more contrast/sharpness but I like the composition.  Gave it an 6, hope to see you above 60% at least.</td>', 'Hope you don´t get voted down from people that only think of tacks as being those little pointy things but my guess is you aren´t doing to well because of narrow minded people.  Anyway, good shot but not exceptional either, needs something to make it go "wow" like a dramatic sunset in the clould or something. It could also use a little bit more contrast/sharpness but I like the composition.  Gave it an 6, hope to see you above 60% at least.', '2005-04-16 12:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296196, 167049, 24951, '<td valign="top">Too much focus on the big toe and hair rather than tac and perhaps the other toes instead.</td>', 'Too much focus on the big toe and hair rather than tac and perhaps the other toes instead.', '2005-04-16 12:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296200, 166957, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This must have taken hours to set up.  Extremely well done.  you are very meticulous aren''t you?  Too bad there are no tacks in this image. ;) 9 for putting so much time and effort into a 24 hour challenge and getting good results.</td>', 'Wow.  This must have taken hours to set up.  Extremely well done.  you are very meticulous aren''t you?  Too bad there are no tacks in this image. ;) 9 for putting so much time and effort into a 24 hour challenge and getting good results.', '2005-04-16 12:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296204, 166810, 34192, '<td valign="top">All you are missing is the angel.  Too bad there are no tacks in this image. ;)  How did oyu do that?  Like the color, DOF, POV, subject and composition. excellent work!  9 from me!</td>', 'All you are missing is the angel.  Too bad there are no tacks in this image. ;)  How did oyu do that?  Like the color, DOF, POV, subject and composition. excellent work!  9 from me!', '2005-04-16 12:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296207, 166964, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am not saying I could do better but there is one thing that really bothers me in this shot and that is the fact that half her face is out of the frame and the other half is looking out of it.  Cool that you should break "the rules" like that but still it isn´t working here IMHO.  Otherwise, flawless lighting and contrast/sharpness/colours.  Gave it an 8 and I wouldn´t be surprised to see this on the front page in a week or at least in the top 10.<br/> <br/>(ef þetta er ekki mynd eftir Árna Torfa skal ég hundur heita)</td>', 'I am not saying I could do better but there is one thing that really bothers me in this shot and that is the fact that half her face is out of the frame and the other half is looking out of it.  Cool that you should break "the rules" like that but still it isn´t working here IMHO.  Otherwise, flawless lighting and contrast/sharpness/colours.  Gave it an 8 and I wouldn´t be surprised to see this on the front page in a week or at least in the top 10. (ef þetta er ekki mynd eftir Árna Torfa skal ég hundur heita)', '2005-04-16 12:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
