(1296211, 166917, 34192, '<td valign="top">I see no tacks. ;)  focus and POV are good. Could use better lighting.  Wish I had a 100 million.  7 may bump later.</td>', 'I see no tacks. ;)  focus and POV are good. Could use better lighting.  Wish I had a 100 million.  7 may bump later.', '2005-04-16 12:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
