(1296364, 166880, 34192, '<td valign="top">this looks painful.  And there are real tacks!  Ouch!  Believe it or not, I have the EXACT same toilet paper holder.  Small world isn''t it.  I really like this.  I imagine that is what toilet paper feels like to hemmoroid sufferers.  Ouch! 8 for originality, good focus and excellent taste in toilet paper holders.</td>', 'this looks painful.  And there are real tacks!  Ouch!  Believe it or not, I have the EXACT same toilet paper holder.  Small world isn''t it.  I really like this.  I imagine that is what toilet paper feels like to hemmoroid sufferers.  Ouch! 8 for originality, good focus and excellent taste in toilet paper holders.', '2005-04-16 13:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296366, 167062, 34192, '<td valign="top">Where''s the angel?  Very simple and straight forward composition.  I actually kind of like the simplicity.  The off-white color of the background throws me a little as I expect it to be white, but that''s my issue.  I like that you got the detail in the upside down tack.  The focus is good. 7</td>', 'Where''s the angel?  Very simple and straight forward composition.  I actually kind of like the simplicity.  The off-white color of the background throws me a little as I expect it to be white, but that''s my issue.  I like that you got the detail in the upside down tack.  The focus is good. 7', '2005-04-16 13:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
