(1296814, 166901, 15810, '<td valign="top">Another popular mirror shot. This is well executed but I t would have made a difference if the drawing pins were new or polished or contained an interesting reflection. Were they deliberately dulled down?</td>', 'Another popular mirror shot. This is well executed but I t would have made a difference if the drawing pins were new or polished or contained an interesting reflection. Were they deliberately dulled down?', '2005-04-16 19:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
