(1296826, 166795, 15810, '<td valign="top">how very very odd. I find myself likingthis shot a lot but I have no idea what I''m looking at or what your trying to say. I do like the shot though especially the interesting lighting.</td>', 'how very very odd. I find myself likingthis shot a lot but I have no idea what I''m looking at or what your trying to say. I do like the shot though especially the interesting lighting.', '2005-04-16 19:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
