(1296854, 167022, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice image, sharp as a tack. I had used tic tac too, but failed the submission deadline. I did post it in my portfolio. Yours is far better. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice image, sharp as a tack. I had used tic tac too, but failed the submission deadline. I did post it in my portfolio. Yours is far better. Good luck.', '2005-04-16 20:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
