(1296882, 166741, 35078, '<td valign="top">Good to see someone else is looking outside the square, although I don''t think that its appreciated by some of the members. (Probably from land-locked States or countries!) Good work. 10!</td>', 'Good to see someone else is looking outside the square, although I don''t think that its appreciated by some of the members. (Probably from land-locked States or countries!) Good work. 10!', '2005-04-16 20:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296894, 166691, 35078, '<td valign="top">Good work thinking outside the square! I''m guessing people will be marking you down because of their narrow minded views. The picture itself is a little out of focus, but I''m going to give you and the sailing photos a 10 to make up for the others! Read the forums if you get a chance.</td>', 'Good work thinking outside the square! I''m guessing people will be marking you down because of their narrow minded views. The picture itself is a little out of focus, but I''m going to give you and the sailing photos a 10 to make up for the others! Read the forums if you get a chance.', '2005-04-16 20:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296901, 166854, 36557, '<td valign="top">good stuff...my only criticism is that the composition is too busy.  i love the fact that you''re doing this though...very cool.</td>', 'good stuff...my only criticism is that the composition is too busy.  i love the fact that you''re doing this though...very cool.', '2005-04-16 20:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
