(1296972, 166751, 33652, '<td valign="top">I''m calling the RSPCW!  :)</td>', 'I''m calling the RSPCW!  :)', '2005-04-16 21:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296976, 167038, 33652, '<td valign="top">nice use of colour</td>', 'nice use of colour', '2005-04-16 21:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296982, 166912, 33652, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!</td>', 'Brilliant!', '2005-04-16 21:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296987, 166741, 33652, '<td valign="top">Loverly colour.</td>', 'Loverly colour.', '2005-04-16 21:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296994, 166747, 34192, '<td valign="top">Cool tacks!   Interesting use of a classic image. Composition color and focus well done.  7 from me!</td>', 'Cool tacks!   Interesting use of a classic image. Composition color and focus well done.  7 from me!', '2005-04-16 21:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296996, 166984, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hurts doesn''t it!  I see no TACKS in this image!  ;)  Focus and color are good.  Image slightly boring but effective use of tacks. and there are more than 1! 6 from me!</td>', 'Hurts doesn''t it!  I see no TACKS in this image!  ;)  Focus and color are good.  Image slightly boring but effective use of tacks. and there are more than 1! 6 from me!', '2005-04-16 21:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296999, 166815, 34192, '<td valign="top">Ow!  You impaled him.  There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  I think the green and red tacks balance each other out.  I like the composition and the DOF.  POV okay.  6 from me!</td>', 'Ow!  You impaled him.  There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  I think the green and red tacks balance each other out.  I like the composition and the DOF.  POV okay.  6 from me!', '2005-04-16 21:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297000, 166995, 34192, '<td valign="top">Ouch.  I know you had to put a little pressure on the tips to get them to stay and too much pressure and they go flying so a good balance.  But, there are no TACKS in this image! ;) The green background works well here. Your DOF and point of view are good. 7 from me!</td>', 'Ouch.  I know you had to put a little pressure on the tips to get them to stay and too much pressure and they go flying so a good balance.  But, there are no TACKS in this image! ;) The green background works well here. Your DOF and point of view are good. 7 from me!', '2005-04-16 21:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297003, 166939, 34192, '<td valign="top">Euw!  There is only one TACK in this image! ;)  The drippy blood stuff looks really fake.  Almost like it was post edited in.  Pretty grusome though.  I will give you a 5 because you  tried to gross me out!</td>', 'Euw!  There is only one TACK in this image! ;)  The drippy blood stuff looks really fake.  Almost like it was post edited in.  Pretty grusome though.  I will give you a 5 because you  tried to gross me out!', '2005-04-16 21:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297006, 166926, 34192, '<td valign="top">There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Actually I think this is a pretty cool image.  Its a macro with a good DOF.  POV and colors are good.  And you managed to balance the tack - no easy feat. 8 for a clear well planned image.</td>', 'There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Actually I think this is a pretty cool image.  Its a macro with a good DOF.  POV and colors are good.  And you managed to balance the tack - no easy feat. 8 for a clear well planned image.', '2005-04-16 21:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297008, 166980, 34192, '<td valign="top">you made me giggle.  I know its supposed to be a solemn occasion.  There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Color and shadow are a little off.  Focus is a little soft.  Original idea though - good use of some tacks. 5</td>', 'you made me giggle.  I know its supposed to be a solemn occasion.  There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Color and shadow are a little off.  Focus is a little soft.  Original idea though - good use of some tacks. 5', '2005-04-16 21:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297011, 166912, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hey - I''ve seen this before!  Wait - that was a branch.  There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Good choice using a blue tack - greeny would have been tacky.  Good DOF for a macro shot.  Good originality.  8 because I want to.  When is the drop going to fall?  I can''t wait any longer!</td>', 'Hey - I''ve seen this before!  Wait - that was a branch.  There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Good choice using a blue tack - greeny would have been tacky.  Good DOF for a macro shot.  Good originality.  8 because I want to.  When is the drop going to fall?  I can''t wait any longer!', '2005-04-16 21:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297013, 167022, 33725, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I predict a first place finish.<br/></td>', 'Very nice!  I predict a first place finish.', '2005-04-16 21:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297014, 166937, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  How''d you do that?  There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Red and white - crisp and clean.  Maybe a little over sharpened.  They kind of float there - I wish there was something to ''hold them down.''  Interesting shot - 6 for balancing on the head of a tack.</td>', 'Wow.  How''d you do that?  There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Red and white - crisp and clean.  Maybe a little over sharpened.  They kind of float there - I wish there was something to ''hold them down.''  Interesting shot - 6 for balancing on the head of a tack.', '2005-04-16 21:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297015, 167023, 33725, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I predict a top-three finish.<br/></td>', 'Nice.  I predict a top-three finish.', '2005-04-16 21:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297018, 166738, 33725, '<td valign="top">good humor, but focus and blown-out highlights forced a low score</td>', 'good humor, but focus and blown-out highlights forced a low score', '2005-04-16 21:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297021, 166872, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Shiny.  But there are no TACKS in this image! ;)  I think it may have been improved if the tacks were blue or red - the clear somehow gets lost.  Was this converted to B&amp;W?  Nice job with the focus and the tonal range.  7 from me!</td>', 'Wow.  Shiny.  But there are no TACKS in this image! ;)  I think it may have been improved if the tacks were blue or red - the clear somehow gets lost.  Was this converted to B&W?  Nice job with the focus and the tonal range.  7 from me!', '2005-04-16 21:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297025, 166972, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  there are no TACKS in this image! ;) Like the red ones hat.  Reminds me of me.  Except I hate pink and wouldn''t be caught dead in a pink hat.  Such is life.  I like where you were going here.  I think it may have worked a little better with a less harsh background.  The yellow tacks also seem a little harsh but I think thats due to the white being so strong.   7 for originality and a decent macro.</td>', 'Hmmm.  there are no TACKS in this image! ;) Like the red ones hat.  Reminds me of me.  Except I hate pink and wouldn''t be caught dead in a pink hat.  Such is life.  I like where you were going here.  I think it may have worked a little better with a less harsh background.  The yellow tacks also seem a little harsh but I think thats due to the white being so strong.   7 for originality and a decent macro.', '2005-04-16 21:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297028, 167054, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hey - Real tacks!  What kind of camera?  Pretty good - color is a little off. 6</td>', 'Hey - Real tacks!  What kind of camera?  Pretty good - color is a little off. 6', '2005-04-16 21:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297032, 167052, 34192, '<td valign="top">Ahhh.  Political statement.  But there are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Like the ''no'' sign on your tack.  Clear, in focus, uncluttered.    The tack is a little too shiny from the lighting but  a good effort. 6 from me!</td>', 'Ahhh.  Political statement.  But there are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Like the ''no'' sign on your tack.  Clear, in focus, uncluttered.    The tack is a little too shiny from the lighting but  a good effort. 6 from me!', '2005-04-16 21:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297034, 166958, 34192, '<td valign="top">Cool, unique, and original. But there are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Wow - the sharpness is great in this image.  Composition and color good.  Excellent POV. 8 from me!</td>', 'Cool, unique, and original. But there are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Wow - the sharpness is great in this image.  Composition and color good.  Excellent POV. 8 from me!', '2005-04-16 21:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297036, 167039, 34192, '<td valign="top">There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Interesting concept.  Poor flower.  Like the DOV and POV .  The top tack is in good focus.  Composition good. 7 from me!</td>', 'There are no TACKS in this image! ;)  Interesting concept.  Poor flower.  Like the DOV and POV .  The top tack is in good focus.  Composition good. 7 from me!', '2005-04-16 21:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
