(1298031, 166984, 33947, '<td valign="top">Light is pretty flat, and the diagonal line cutting the picture in two is a distraction. But, I like your idea and I like how you cropped it.</td>', 'Light is pretty flat, and the diagonal line cutting the picture in two is a distraction. But, I like your idea and I like how you cropped it.', '2005-04-17 15:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
