(1298290, 166954, 10261, '<td valign="top">My initial comment was that I saw no tacks in this image. Since I''ve lived in the center of a continent all my life, the sailing reference was initially lost on me. Hopefully the voters won''t penalized you too much for your alternative interpretation of the topic.<br/> <br/>I can''t decide whether I like the way this image is cropped . I''m inclined to say that there should be more sky, but the reflection of the mast adds a nice balanced feel to the image. Moving the waterline to the center of the frame would have increased the balance, but that might just add too much negative space. Anyway, thanks for adding variety to the challenge.</td>', 'My initial comment was that I saw no tacks in this image. Since I''ve lived in the center of a continent all my life, the sailing reference was initially lost on me. Hopefully the voters won''t penalized you too much for your alternative interpretation of the topic. I can''t decide whether I like the way this image is cropped . I''m inclined to say that there should be more sky, but the reflection of the mast adds a nice balanced feel to the image. Moving the waterline to the center of the frame would have increased the balance, but that might just add too much negative space. Anyway, thanks for adding variety to the challenge.', '2005-04-17 18:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1298308, 167029, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that this is the only image in the challenge that made me laugh. Nicely executed; the sword is an especially nice touch.</td>', 'I think that this is the only image in the challenge that made me laugh. Nicely executed; the sword is an especially nice touch.', '2005-04-17 18:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
