(1300820, 166919, 17033, '<td valign="top">My favourite of this type of shot in this challenge. Good composition and lighting. All the pain evident but without the grossness of most of the feet on display. You must tell me your podiatrist!!</td>', 'My favourite of this type of shot in this challenge. Good composition and lighting. All the pain evident but without the grossness of most of the feet on display. You must tell me your podiatrist!!', '2005-04-18 15:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
