(1300836, 166739, 17033, '<td valign="top">Only the background appears to be in focus but is out of the range of the flash. I think you know what''s wrong with this and can go on to better things.</td>', 'Only the background appears to be in focus but is out of the range of the flash. I think you know what''s wrong with this and can go on to better things.', '2005-04-18 15:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300851, 166980, 17033, '<td valign="top">Just not enough here to grab my attention....stronger set-up and composition needed.Also lighting and focus not quite there. I''m sure you''d do better with a different challenge theme that was based outside....keep going!</td>', 'Just not enough here to grab my attention....stronger set-up and composition needed.Also lighting and focus not quite there. I''m sure you''d do better with a different challenge theme that was based outside....keep going!', '2005-04-18 15:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1300869, 166879, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice twist on what otherwise is a conventional tack shot! This is one of my favorites so far. Iove the colors and the strong focus on the bent tack.</td>', 'Nice twist on what otherwise is a conventional tack shot! This is one of my favorites so far. Iove the colors and the strong focus on the bent tack.', '2005-04-18 15:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
