(1307458, 166803, 27524, '<td valign="top">I like colors and focus a lot... all is nice but together doesnt keep attention long.</td>', 'I like colors and focus a lot... all is nice but together doesnt keep attention long.', '2005-04-20 09:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307466, 167019, 27524, '<td valign="top">:) Interesting... looks like mine. Nice light and shades.</td>', ':) Interesting... looks like mine. Nice light and shades.', '2005-04-20 09:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307496, 167023, 27524, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. If it doesnt win then...<br/>Good job, good luck.</td>', 'This is wonderful. If it doesnt win then...Good job, good luck.', '2005-04-20 09:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307500, 166713, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice picture...well done.</td>', 'Nice picture...well done.', '2005-04-20 09:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307506, 166741, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo as it stands.  Very nice colors, good composition with the boat coming into the photo at an angle.   Exposure is right on.  However, this photo is like a fish out of water for this challenge.  Yes, sailing tacks technically works for the challenge but without showing a sail it''s a thin connection.  I''m afraid even with the descriptive title (without the title the connection to challenge is tenuous) many aren''t going to get, or appreciate, this entry.  I would definitely put this on DPCPrints.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is a great photo as it stands.  Very nice colors, good composition with the boat coming into the photo at an angle.   Exposure is right on.  However, this photo is like a fish out of water for this challenge.  Yes, sailing tacks technically works for the challenge but without showing a sail it''s a thin connection.  I''m afraid even with the descriptive title (without the title the connection to challenge is tenuous) many aren''t going to get, or appreciate, this entry.  I would definitely put this on DPCPrints.  Good luck!', '2005-04-20 09:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307539, 167057, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep - Here''s the winner!  It''s fun plus the photo itself is well put together.  Good use of light to simulate the sun, everything is in focus, etc...  Great Job!  Enjoy your ribbon!  ;^)</td>', 'Yep - Here''s the winner!  It''s fun plus the photo itself is well put together.  Good use of light to simulate the sun, everything is in focus, etc...  Great Job!  Enjoy your ribbon!  ;^)', '2005-04-20 09:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307546, 166803, 30049, '<td valign="top">I imagine you''re getting beat up a bit for only having on tack instead of being tacks (plural)!  ;^)  I would love to see this photo win.  It''s an image that is suitable for framing.  I really like the color, the composition with the wood angling across and the tack cutting diagonally the other direction.  Good clear focus on the tack.  Kudos to you for not taking the funny tack(less) approach to this challenge.  Great job, and good luck!</td>', 'I imagine you''re getting beat up a bit for only having on tack instead of being tacks (plural)!  ;^)  I would love to see this photo win.  It''s an image that is suitable for framing.  I really like the color, the composition with the wood angling across and the tack cutting diagonally the other direction.  Good clear focus on the tack.  Kudos to you for not taking the funny tack(less) approach to this challenge.  Great job, and good luck!', '2005-04-20 09:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307555, 166912, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh no - not another water droplet image!  ;^)  Nice photo...  Was it intentional to have the pin part of this pushpin bent?  If not it was a cool accident.  The bend mirrors the curve in the rock below it.  Great focus, nice composition.  Only downside I have is the image size - it''s 20% smaller than allowed.  Good luck!</td>', 'Oh no - not another water droplet image!  ;^)  Nice photo...  Was it intentional to have the pin part of this pushpin bent?  If not it was a cool accident.  The bend mirrors the curve in the rock below it.  Great focus, nice composition.  Only downside I have is the image size - it''s 20% smaller than allowed.  Good luck!', '2005-04-20 09:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307563, 166963, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple.  I like it.  You''re probably taking a little heat for not having ''Tacks'' (plural), but it''s fine in my book.  The bottom front of the pushpin is a bit hot, but tricky to avoid.  It looks like you used white paper for the background and it''s coming across a little noisy.  You know it''s not, but the paper makes it appear that way.  Neat Image could have ironed that out a bit for you.  Overall, great job.  Good luck!</td>', 'Clean and simple.  I like it.  You''re probably taking a little heat for not having ''Tacks'' (plural), but it''s fine in my book.  The bottom front of the pushpin is a bit hot, but tricky to avoid.  It looks like you used white paper for the background and it''s coming across a little noisy.  You know it''s not, but the paper makes it appear that way.  Neat Image could have ironed that out a bit for you.  Overall, great job.  Good luck!', '2005-04-20 10:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307750, 166934, 33893, '<td valign="top">Cute idea! I might have added a face to the pear though... just a thought!</td>', 'Cute idea! I might have added a face to the pear though... just a thought!', '2005-04-20 11:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307753, 167003, 33893, '<td valign="top">Well done! Good lighting and DOF! The only things I might change is to fill out the left side of the shot with more tacks, in not to interupt the repeating pattern.</td>', 'Well done! Good lighting and DOF! The only things I might change is to fill out the left side of the shot with more tacks, in not to interupt the repeating pattern.', '2005-04-20 11:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1307757, 166912, 33893, '<td valign="top">Wow! That couldn''t have been easy to get just right!</td>', 'Wow! That couldn''t have been easy to get just right!', '2005-04-20 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1);
