(1308341, 166810, 31213, '<td valign="top">Looking at the top tack it seems over shqarpened.  The plastic an looks great....love the composition and idea, but I wish the clear parts of the tacks came out a little better.  They seem almost soft focus but gritty.  Hard to explain.  I''m at work now, so I''ll look again on my LCD screen at home in a few hours.  You''re work never fails to impress me.  I love how you always stay true to your style.  Nice job and keep em coming!!</td>', 'Looking at the top tack it seems over shqarpened.  The plastic an looks great....love the composition and idea, but I wish the clear parts of the tacks came out a little better.  They seem almost soft focus but gritty.  Hard to explain.  I''m at work now, so I''ll look again on my LCD screen at home in a few hours.  You''re work never fails to impress me.  I love how you always stay true to your style.  Nice job and keep em coming!!', '2005-04-20 15:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308344, 166963, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very simple and very nice.  One thing I did with my entry that I think would have made this even stronger would have been to burn in the shadow a bit.  It would have added more dramatic contrast.  Love the clarity and simplicity.  Beautifully done.</td>', 'Very simple and very nice.  One thing I did with my entry that I think would have made this even stronger would have been to burn in the shadow a bit.  It would have added more dramatic contrast.  Love the clarity and simplicity.  Beautifully done.', '2005-04-20 15:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308348, 166738, 31213, '<td valign="top">Best of the hairy feet tack pictures yet!  :)  Nicely done .</td>', 'Best of the hairy feet tack pictures yet!  :)  Nicely done .', '2005-04-20 15:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308351, 166840, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2005-04-20 15:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308356, 166917, 31213, '<td valign="top">Kind of greyish and flat.  I would have liked to see a bit of a contrast boost here.  It would ahve made a world of difference.  I also would to have liked to see the point of the tack behind your first tack.  Composition is interesting but I dont like the hidden point of the background tack.  Picky aren''t I?  Nice job.</td>', 'Kind of greyish and flat.  I would have liked to see a bit of a contrast boost here.  It would ahve made a world of difference.  I also would to have liked to see the point of the tack behind your first tack.  Composition is interesting but I dont like the hidden point of the background tack.  Picky aren''t I?  Nice job.', '2005-04-20 15:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308362, 166737, 31213, '<td valign="top">Arent those nails?  <br/> <br/> <br/>Love the compleity of the patterns and the clear reflections.  Should do well if people accept the nails as tacks.</td>', 'Arent those nails?    Love the compleity of the patterns and the clear reflections.  Should do well if people accept the nails as tacks.', '2005-04-20 15:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308363, 167060, 31213, '<td valign="top">Simple and pleasant.  I love it!  8!</td>', 'Simple and pleasant.  I love it!  8!', '2005-04-20 15:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308367, 167003, 31213, '<td valign="top">Simple and creative photograph.  I like it!  Nice job on the focus and clarity.  Very pleasant visually.  :))</td>', 'Simple and creative photograph.  I like it!  Nice job on the focus and clarity.  Very pleasant visually.  :))', '2005-04-20 15:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308380, 167022, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very creative!</td>', 'Very creative!', '2005-04-20 15:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308484, 166987, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I liek how each tack is in a different position.  Not many people used water with their tacks.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice image.  I liek how each tack is in a different position.  Not many people used water with their tacks.  Nice work.', '2005-04-20 16:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308487, 166957, 31213, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Lots of time and prep probably went into this.  Very good.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!  Lots of time and prep probably went into this.  Very good. ', '2005-04-20 16:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308490, 167019, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very visually pleasant image.  Its simple, yet engaging.  I like the clarity and texture of the egg.  Some thought obviously went into the lighting.  This will be reflected in the score I give you :)  One of the best in the challenge.  :)</td>', 'Very visually pleasant image.  Its simple, yet engaging.  I like the clarity and texture of the egg.  Some thought obviously went into the lighting.  This will be reflected in the score I give you :)  One of the best in the challenge.  :)', '2005-04-20 16:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308495, 166797, 31213, '<td valign="top">The composition and lighting are great!  The Photoshopped flare at the tip is a little overkill in my opinion.  Nicely done overall though.</td>', 'The composition and lighting are great!  The Photoshopped flare at the tip is a little overkill in my opinion.  Nicely done overall though.', '2005-04-20 16:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308499, 166798, 31213, '<td valign="top">If this was just a little bit sharper it would have been absolutely stunning.  Still very unique and well composed.  Nice job.</td>', 'If this was just a little bit sharper it would have been absolutely stunning.  Still very unique and well composed.  Nice job.', '2005-04-20 16:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308502, 167049, 31213, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W for this would have been more powerfull.  Like the idea though.</td>', 'B&W for this would have been more powerfull.  Like the idea though.', '2005-04-20 16:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308507, 167009, 31213, '<td valign="top">I love the uniform white background.  Very even and well exposed.  These kinds of images work better in B&amp;W in my opinion though.</td>', 'I love the uniform white background.  Very even and well exposed.  These kinds of images work better in B&W in my opinion though.', '2005-04-20 16:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308519, 166865, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the clarity and composition of this shot.  I''m a little confused by the blue gel under the tacks though.  Is that to just give contrast between the tacks and the surface of the plate or counter?  At first I thought this shot seemed a bit tight, but the more I evaluate it, the more I think it works.  I have a feelign this will get a lower score than it deserves.  Sometimes thinking outside of the box does that though.  Taking chances is what its all about.  :))  Goodluck!</td>', 'Love the clarity and composition of this shot.  I''m a little confused by the blue gel under the tacks though.  Is that to just give contrast between the tacks and the surface of the plate or counter?  At first I thought this shot seemed a bit tight, but the more I evaluate it, the more I think it works.  I have a feelign this will get a lower score than it deserves.  Sometimes thinking outside of the box does that though.  Taking chances is what its all about.  :))  Goodluck!', '2005-04-20 16:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308523, 166975, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the shot and color tones, but I bet you''ll get ripped by people cause your subject is not a tack....its a screw or a nail.  I dont know if you did this on purpose or if you just didnt have a tack available.  Love the motion of the hammer and emotion of the shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'Love the shot and color tones, but I bet you''ll get ripped by people cause your subject is not a tack....its a screw or a nail.  I dont know if you did this on purpose or if you just didnt have a tack available.  Love the motion of the hammer and emotion of the shot.  Nice work.', '2005-04-20 16:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308669, 166996, 23203, '<td valign="top">This is so neat.. great idea, well executed. 10</td>', 'This is so neat.. great idea, well executed. 10', '2005-04-20 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308704, 166980, 23053, '<td valign="top">I think the shadows are the most interesting part of this shot.  There is something off here, though.  The shot seems slightly soft and may be in need of some different cropping.</td>', 'I think the shadows are the most interesting part of this shot.  There is something off here, though.  The shot seems slightly soft and may be in need of some different cropping.', '2005-04-20 17:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308714, 166738, 23053, '<td valign="top">Strange how the desat makes the tack look like it''s glowing...unless you did that on purpose.  Who knows.  I like that most of the image is blurred aside from the tack, but it seems like post-processing and seems over the top.</td>', 'Strange how the desat makes the tack look like it''s glowing...unless you did that on purpose.  Who knows.  I like that most of the image is blurred aside from the tack, but it seems like post-processing and seems over the top.', '2005-04-20 17:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1308733, 167047, 23053, '<td valign="top">Looks like a mushroom cloud from an atom bomb.  So, did you run out of time on the challenge half way through your in-fill?</td>', 'Looks like a mushroom cloud from an atom bomb.  So, did you run out of time on the challenge half way through your in-fill?', '2005-04-20 17:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
