(1309205, 166713, 19708, '<td valign="top">This will be one to see how it was done.<br/>Well done by the way - simple, well converted (and a good choice for  B&amp;W too) and defies logic, which holds my eyes to it.</td>', 'This will be one to see how it was done.Well done by the way - simple, well converted (and a good choice for  B&W too) and defies logic, which holds my eyes to it.', '2005-04-20 20:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
