(1309212, 166996, 19708, '<td valign="top">This one required some studying, and glad it did, as I may have missed some of it''s finer (and subtle) details. The $ signs make it! Well done!</td>', 'This one required some studying, and glad it did, as I may have missed some of it''s finer (and subtle) details. The $ signs make it! Well done!', '2005-04-20 20:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
