(1311096, 166803, 29269, '<td valign="top">A very interesting take on the challenge, and an excellent image with great DOF.<br/>Critique: the lower left part has the lighter shade of wood or something else. I would have preferred to see it either cropped or cloned or both.<br/>I also like the light reflection on the top of the tack, but it would have been interesting to see what it would look like with the light source coming from the front-left, illuminating more of the dark areas of the tack. I''m not sure if that would make the whole image better or not, but it would eliminate the shade in the front.</td>', 'A very interesting take on the challenge, and an excellent image with great DOF.Critique: the lower left part has the lighter shade of wood or something else. I would have preferred to see it either cropped or cloned or both.I also like the light reflection on the top of the tack, but it would have been interesting to see what it would look like with the light source coming from the front-left, illuminating more of the dark areas of the tack. I''m not sure if that would make the whole image better or not, but it would eliminate the shade in the front.', '2005-04-21 14:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
