(1312457, 166964, 10261, '<td valign="top">Your model needs to work on her posture. Her intent gaze off-screen is intriguing, and her placement in the frame creates a strong impression. I can''t decide whether short, spiky hair would add or detract from the rest of the presentation. This is easily my favorite shot in the challenge so far.<br/>-----<br/>Coming back after voting on all of the other entries; this is still my favorite.<br/></td>', 'Your model needs to work on her posture. Her intent gaze off-screen is intriguing, and her placement in the frame creates a strong impression. I can''t decide whether short, spiky hair would add or detract from the rest of the presentation. This is easily my favorite shot in the challenge so far.-----Coming back after voting on all of the other entries; this is still my favorite.', '2005-04-22 00:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
