(1312576, 167013, 20889, '<td valign="top">pretty good little illusion with the screws, I can tell there stcaked</td>', 'pretty good little illusion with the screws, I can tell there stcaked', '2005-04-22 01:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312796, 166690, 33924, '<td valign="top">The lighting and color of this photo is really lovely, and would be very effective as a commercial product photo. The blue highlights picked up by the foreground tacks and the white highlights in the background tacks really add to the strength of the photo. Great job!</td>', 'The lighting and color of this photo is really lovely, and would be very effective as a commercial product photo. The blue highlights picked up by the foreground tacks and the white highlights in the background tacks really add to the strength of the photo. Great job!', '2005-04-22 08:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312798, 166911, 33924, '<td valign="top">I love the story told by your photo. The gold tacks are so effectively highlighted and reflected and the black all around makes for a very strong contrast. 10</td>', 'I love the story told by your photo. The gold tacks are so effectively highlighted and reflected and the black all around makes for a very strong contrast. 10', '2005-04-22 08:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312799, 166964, 33924, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the story behind this picture but maybe that doesn''t matter; it''s a very strong photo, nevertheless. I love the contrast of the pale-skinned woman(Gwyneth Paltrow?) against the orangey-red background. Having her in the corner of the photo is great, makes the tacks against her skin stand out. Also, her blue eye looks bluer due to the blue tacks in the picture. One distracting element, I think, is her earring. But otherwise a great shot. 9</td>', 'I don''t get the story behind this picture but maybe that doesn''t matter; it''s a very strong photo, nevertheless. I love the contrast of the pale-skinned woman(Gwyneth Paltrow?) against the orangey-red background. Having her in the corner of the photo is great, makes the tacks against her skin stand out. Also, her blue eye looks bluer due to the blue tacks in the picture. One distracting element, I think, is her earring. But otherwise a great shot. 9', '2005-04-22 08:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312805, 167023, 33924, '<td valign="top">Despite the fact that I''m getting a bit tired of seeing photos of glasses of various colors of water, I do think this is a stunning photo. The green is such a strong green, like green Jello and the composition of showing only a portion of the glass and placing it to one side adds to the photo''s strengh. The tack cutting through the water doesn''t really make sense, logically, but who cares, it creates a focal point that is powerful in its movement into the water.The splash created is gorgeous. Great job! 9</td>', 'Despite the fact that I''m getting a bit tired of seeing photos of glasses of various colors of water, I do think this is a stunning photo. The green is such a strong green, like green Jello and the composition of showing only a portion of the glass and placing it to one side adds to the photo''s strengh. The tack cutting through the water doesn''t really make sense, logically, but who cares, it creates a focal point that is powerful in its movement into the water.The splash created is gorgeous. Great job! 9', '2005-04-22 09:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1312815, 166741, 33924, '<td valign="top">I don''t know anything about sailing tacks, but what does it matter - this shot is gorgeous. The various colors of blue blend so beautifully together, with the red adding a lovely touch of contrast. The composition with the boat cutting through the frame from the right is very nice and the chain leading into the water is a beautiful detail that helps to keep the viewer''s eyes within the picture. Very nice! 9</td>', 'I don''t know anything about sailing tacks, but what does it matter - this shot is gorgeous. The various colors of blue blend so beautifully together, with the red adding a lovely touch of contrast. The composition with the boat cutting through the frame from the right is very nice and the chain leading into the water is a beautiful detail that helps to keep the viewer''s eyes within the picture. Very nice! 9', '2005-04-22 09:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313097, 166865, 34759, '<td valign="top">I love this one. Beautiful colors!</td>', 'I love this one. Beautiful colors!', '2005-04-22 11:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
