(1313511, 167064, 9821, '<td valign="top">very funny ... good job</td>', 'very funny ... good job', '2005-04-22 14:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313513, 167029, 9821, '<td valign="top">makes me smile ... had to rate it high :) ... 9</td>', 'makes me smile ... had to rate it high :) ... 9', '2005-04-22 14:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313515, 167022, 9821, '<td valign="top">very clever idea ... 9</td>', 'very clever idea ... 9', '2005-04-22 14:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313612, 166918, 26741, '<td valign="top">With the already-busy black/white patterns, I find the tilted horizon just a bit too distracting. Maybe a little less tilt?  Had to look pretty hard to notice the tack.  Good shot, otherwise!</td>', 'With the already-busy black/white patterns, I find the tilted horizon just a bit too distracting. Maybe a little less tilt?  Had to look pretty hard to notice the tack.  Good shot, otherwise!', '2005-04-22 15:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313614, 167063, 26741, '<td valign="top">Great composition! I like the shallow DOF</td>', 'Great composition! I like the shallow DOF', '2005-04-22 15:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313617, 167052, 26741, '<td valign="top">Neat concept and composition!  Very creative!  I find the shadow of the tack a bit distracting, but maybe that''s part of the point of the political statement.</td>', 'Neat concept and composition!  Very creative!  I find the shadow of the tack a bit distracting, but maybe that''s part of the point of the political statement.', '2005-04-22 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313621, 166934, 26741, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, but the background is a little too close.  It becomes a distraction.</td>', 'Nice clarity, but the background is a little too close.  It becomes a distraction.', '2005-04-22 15:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313622, 166738, 26741, '<td valign="top">The foot is a bit too out of focus.  I had to really look to figure out what it was.</td>', 'The foot is a bit too out of focus.  I had to really look to figure out what it was.', '2005-04-22 15:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313627, 167023, 26741, '<td valign="top">VERY cool...maybe it''s just the refraction from the water, but the tack looks a bit bent.  Otherwise, an awesome shot! 9 from me!</td>', 'VERY cool...maybe it''s just the refraction from the water, but the tack looks a bit bent.  Otherwise, an awesome shot! 9 from me!', '2005-04-22 15:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313631, 167043, 26741, '<td valign="top">Not sure I know where the $3.97 is??? Would have been neat to add the money to the photo with this title!</td>', 'Not sure I know where the $3.97 is??? Would have been neat to add the money to the photo with this title!', '2005-04-22 15:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313640, 166763, 26741, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m just dense, but I don''t get the title.  Nice clear photo, though!</td>', 'Maybe I''m just dense, but I don''t get the title.  Nice clear photo, though!', '2005-04-22 15:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313658, 166870, 26741, '<td valign="top">Dobies are the BEST!  I''ve had two.  They can show such intensity when they want/need to!  How long did it take you to get this?  Did he/she think it was a treat? Great shot!</td>', 'Dobies are the BEST!  I''ve had two.  They can show such intensity when they want/need to!  How long did it take you to get this?  Did he/she think it was a treat? Great shot!', '2005-04-22 15:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313662, 167030, 26741, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus, dust on the flat surface is distracting.  Neat composition, though.</td>', 'Slightly out of focus, dust on the flat surface is distracting.  Neat composition, though.', '2005-04-22 15:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313665, 166695, 26741, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and quality of the photo, but toe hair really grosses me out...maybe I''m just thingy!</td>', 'Like the composition and quality of the photo, but toe hair really grosses me out...maybe I''m just thingy!', '2005-04-22 15:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313671, 166957, 26741, '<td valign="top">How long did it take you to set this up???</td>', 'How long did it take you to set this up???', '2005-04-22 15:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313672, 166906, 26741, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the background.  I think it takes away from the cenral subject</td>', 'Not sure about the background.  I think it takes away from the cenral subject', '2005-04-22 15:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313673, 166814, 26741, '<td valign="top">A few specks of debris among the tacks are distracting. otherwise, a cool shot!</td>', 'A few specks of debris among the tacks are distracting. otherwise, a cool shot!', '2005-04-22 15:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313674, 166970, 26741, '<td valign="top">Yeowww!! You did not really draw blood for this challenge, did you???</td>', 'Yeowww!! You did not really draw blood for this challenge, did you???', '2005-04-22 16:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313675, 167049, 26741, '<td valign="top">The debris on the carpet is distracting.  Great DOF.  Toe hair really bugs me, but maybe that''s just me!</td>', 'The debris on the carpet is distracting.  Great DOF.  Toe hair really bugs me, but maybe that''s just me!', '2005-04-22 16:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313678, 166991, 26741, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit better focus.  Hope you didn''t really hurt yourself for this!</td>', 'Needs a bit better focus.  Hope you didn''t really hurt yourself for this!', '2005-04-22 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313681, 167064, 26741, '<td valign="top">Haha! What a cute concept!</td>', 'Haha! What a cute concept!', '2005-04-22 16:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313684, 166958, 26741, '<td valign="top">Looks like one of those acrobat acts where like 16 people are all balanced on one guy on the bottom!  Unique concept, great shot!</td>', 'Looks like one of those acrobat acts where like 16 people are all balanced on one guy on the bottom!  Unique concept, great shot!', '2005-04-22 16:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313686, 166803, 26741, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, but is this a tack or a nail?</td>', 'Beautiful photo, but is this a tack or a nail?', '2005-04-22 16:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313690, 166795, 26741, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is, but it''s a neat shot!</td>', 'I have no idea what this is, but it''s a neat shot!', '2005-04-22 16:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313691, 166848, 26741, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, not sure I care for the shadows.</td>', 'Great clarity, not sure I care for the shadows.', '2005-04-22 16:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313693, 166912, 26741, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2005-04-22 16:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313694, 166812, 26741, '<td valign="top">The focus on the tacks is exceptional.  How did you capture this?</td>', 'The focus on the tacks is exceptional.  How did you capture this?', '2005-04-22 16:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313697, 166713, 26741, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I love how the shadows add to the composition of the photo.  Are they glued?  Bumping up</td>', 'Great composition.  I love how the shadows add to the composition of the photo.  Are they glued?  Bumping up', '2005-04-22 16:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313698, 167019, 26741, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to have seen the whole egg in the shot.  Great clarity, though!</td>', 'Would have liked to have seen the whole egg in the shot.  Great clarity, though!', '2005-04-22 16:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313699, 166964, 26741, '<td valign="top">Very nice.   Hopefully she''s not still wearing these!  One of my top picks for this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.   Hopefully she''s not still wearing these!  One of my top picks for this challenge.', '2005-04-22 16:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313700, 166919, 26741, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks</td>', 'One of my top picks', '2005-04-22 16:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1313790, 166964, 17291, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. The color is great.</td>', 'I like this photo. The color is great.', '2005-04-22 17:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314037, 167061, 22781, '<td valign="top">Folds in the background are disturbing.</td>', 'Folds in the background are disturbing.', '2005-04-22 19:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314041, 166966, 22781, '<td valign="top">Folds in the background are disturbing. First strawberry needs focus, tighter crop may work better (too much white at the top)<br/></td>', 'Folds in the background are disturbing. First strawberry needs focus, tighter crop may work better (too much white at the top)', '2005-04-22 19:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314049, 166964, 22781, '<td valign="top">This picture made me stop, that''s always a good or a bad sign.<br/>It''s creative, it''s a good photo, I like your crop, the title makes sense, I like the graduated background. It doesn''t tell me anything, but then, tacks is a realy boring subject, you made something out of it. Hope to see you on the frontpage in a bit.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'This picture made me stop, that''s always a good or a bad sign.It''s creative, it''s a good photo, I like your crop, the title makes sense, I like the graduated background. It doesn''t tell me anything, but then, tacks is a realy boring subject, you made something out of it. Hope to see you on the frontpage in a bit.Good luck.', '2005-04-22 19:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314185, 166957, 12578, '<td valign="top">ALot of effort gone into this, will be rewarded by a good score ! I would however have liked this a little more with more or shall I say less DOF involved! Too much in Focus, the image would be stronger with one part in focal range and teh rest trailing out not in focus...</td>', 'ALot of effort gone into this, will be rewarded by a good score ! I would however have liked this a little more with more or shall I say less DOF involved! Too much in Focus, the image would be stronger with one part in focal range and teh rest trailing out not in focus...', '2005-04-22 20:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314196, 166980, 12578, '<td valign="top">Love the shadow effect yet feel the image is lacking in overall focus and a true focal point</td>', 'Love the shadow effect yet feel the image is lacking in overall focus and a true focal point', '2005-04-22 20:40:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1314228, 167009, 33947, '<td valign="top">Wow, very sharp everywhere. Good depth of field.</td>', 'Wow, very sharp everywhere. Good depth of field.', '2005-04-22 20:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314230, 167037, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect, but, it needs to be a little sharper.</td>', 'Very interesting effect, but, it needs to be a little sharper.', '2005-04-22 21:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314234, 166738, 33947, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you wanted the foot blurry and the tack sharp, but, I found the foot to be too blurry and a distraction.</td>', 'I''m assuming you wanted the foot blurry and the tack sharp, but, I found the foot to be too blurry and a distraction.', '2005-04-22 21:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314242, 167052, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good one!  I think the "no" sign drawn on the tack is the only detracting element, because it''s not as well done as the rest of the photo.  I''d love to have seen a peace sign there.  Also, perhaps the title: "No pre-emptive a-tacks!".  The rest is obvious and left to the viewer.</td>', 'Good one!  I think the "no" sign drawn on the tack is the only detracting element, because it''s not as well done as the rest of the photo.  I''d love to have seen a peace sign there.  Also, perhaps the title: "No pre-emptive a-tacks!".  The rest is obvious and left to the viewer.', '2005-04-22 21:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314293, 166954, 36102, '<td valign="top">After the meaning of tacks for sailing was brought to my attention I came back to say that I get it now....I''ve raised my vote for you.</td>', 'After the meaning of tacks for sailing was brought to my attention I came back to say that I get it now....I''ve raised my vote for you.', '2005-04-22 21:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314401, 167031, 4226, '<td valign="top">Tacks in water and color drop ? just guessing</td>', 'Tacks in water and color drop ? just guessing', '2005-04-22 22:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314405, 166741, 4226, '<td valign="top">looks like a painting ...</td>', 'looks like a painting ...', '2005-04-22 22:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314435, 167030, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and the purple background works great with your idea.</td>', 'Nice lighting and the purple background works great with your idea.', '2005-04-22 23:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314439, 166912, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and I like the way the bend in the pin coincides with the shape of the rock.</td>', 'Nice lighting, and I like the way the bend in the pin coincides with the shape of the rock.', '2005-04-22 23:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314442, 166970, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very realistic coloring, and extremely sharp.</td>', 'Very realistic coloring, and extremely sharp.', '2005-04-22 23:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314448, 167062, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot, and the border works.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot, and the border works.', '2005-04-22 23:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314456, 167038, 33947, '<td valign="top">Neat lighting and highlights. I like how they almost seem to glow.</td>', 'Neat lighting and highlights. I like how they almost seem to glow.', '2005-04-22 23:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314461, 166778, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and I love the way the red one is perfectly sharp while the others are soft. Nice control.</td>', 'Nice lighting, and I love the way the red one is perfectly sharp while the others are soft. Nice control.', '2005-04-22 23:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314466, 166851, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting, and the way you cropped it.</td>', 'I love the lighting, and the way you cropped it.', '2005-04-22 23:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314469, 166812, 33947, '<td valign="top">Fun idea.</td>', 'Fun idea.', '2005-04-22 23:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314471, 167001, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very, very sharp and clear. Nice highlights on the tacks.</td>', 'Very, very sharp and clear. Nice highlights on the tacks.', '2005-04-22 23:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314480, 167024, 33947, '<td valign="top">The silver against the black works nicely, as does your idea to blur the 2nd and 3rd tacks while keeping the first one sharp. Simple and effective compositon. Liked how you cropped it.</td>', 'The silver against the black works nicely, as does your idea to blur the 2nd and 3rd tacks while keeping the first one sharp. Simple and effective compositon. Liked how you cropped it.', '2005-04-22 23:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314487, 166747, 33947, '<td valign="top">Creative, and everything you added is very, very sharp.</td>', 'Creative, and everything you added is very, very sharp.', '2005-04-22 23:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314496, 166749, 33947, '<td valign="top">The white, black and touch of blue works to create a nice, subtle effect, and I like the square cropping and the sharpness.</td>', 'The white, black and touch of blue works to create a nice, subtle effect, and I like the square cropping and the sharpness.', '2005-04-22 23:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314499, 167027, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the title, and the positioning of the dog in the frame.</td>', 'Love the title, and the positioning of the dog in the frame.', '2005-04-22 23:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314503, 167003, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sharpness, clarity and lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful sharpness, clarity and lighting.', '2005-04-22 23:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314505, 166983, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love how sharp and well lit the tacks are.</td>', 'I love how sharp and well lit the tacks are.', '2005-04-22 23:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1314507, 166879, 33947, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.</td>', 'Clever idea.', '2005-04-22 23:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
