(1314844, 166957, 3306, '<td valign="top">It took so long to set this one up, get a satisfactory picture and post it that I didn''t have time to write in the details section. The setup was simple. I used a piece of firm sponge rubber material as the base. I bent up and slightly rotated the back portion of the base to help give the picture depth. Wish I had more time to work on it. I think it could have been done better. Thanks for looking.</td>', 'It took so long to set this one up, get a satisfactory picture and post it that I didn''t have time to write in the details section. The setup was simple. I used a piece of firm sponge rubber material as the base. I bent up and slightly rotated the back portion of the base to help give the picture depth. Wish I had more time to work on it. I think it could have been done better. Thanks for looking.', '2005-04-23 07:41:41.000000', NULL, 0),
