(1315737, 166810, 11518, '<td valign="top">This did not do better because Woody was blurry and the background was too close to Woody, making it too obvious.  Moving the background further away will blur it and using a smaller aperture will get Woody in focus.  Hope this helps.</td>', 'This did not do better because Woody was blurry and the background was too close to Woody, making it too obvious.  Moving the background further away will blur it and using a smaller aperture will get Woody in focus.  Hope this helps.', '2005-04-23 18:02:29.000000', NULL, 0),
