(1404246, 166848, 6306, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why this shot scored so high. There is nothing special about the lighting or the composition, in fact, the photo does not move me in any way at all.</td>', 'I don''t understand why this shot scored so high. There is nothing special about the lighting or the composition, in fact, the photo does not move me in any way at all.', '2005-05-22 19:15:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1411543, 166970, 34247, '<td valign="top">Hi there. I reckon this shot would do real well with a shift in the lighting to bring out the drama factor. It''s nicely focused and the composition works. Color tweaks, though, could increase the impact. I''m saddened that many of the comments here involved "ouch," etc, and not opinions on how this image could be brought more to life. But I reckon a bit of experimentation with edits would truly bring out the image''s potential power. Good luck.</td>', 'Hi there. I reckon this shot would do real well with a shift in the lighting to bring out the drama factor. It''s nicely focused and the composition works. Color tweaks, though, could increase the impact. I''m saddened that many of the comments here involved "ouch," etc, and not opinions on how this image could be brought more to life. But I reckon a bit of experimentation with edits would truly bring out the image''s potential power. Good luck.', '2005-05-25 13:10:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1469861, 167064, 17203, '<td valign="top">That is absolutely hilarious! I missed this one while I was in Italy, but it''s one of the mostest more clever images I''ve seen here. ;-)</td>', 'That is absolutely hilarious! I missed this one while I was in Italy, but it''s one of the mostest more clever images I''ve seen here. ;-)', '2005-06-20 20:09:22.000000', NULL, 0),
