(1558908, 166919, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just ran across this.  I don''t know why, but I just love it and I am NOT a foot lover LOL. The light, the angle, the shadow.  The focus has a softness, yet the image is quite clear. The corner of the shower curtain might be a distraction, but with the overall brown tones, it works perfectly as a nice addition.</td>', 'I just ran across this.  I don''t know why, but I just love it and I am NOT a foot lover LOL. The light, the angle, the shadow.  The focus has a softness, yet the image is quite clear. The corner of the shower curtain might be a distraction, but with the overall brown tones, it works perfectly as a nice addition.', '2005-07-24 15:09:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1566038, 166970, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not a very attractive shot, but technically pretty well done I guess.  Lighting appears to be good.  The underside of the tack is a bit dark, but nothing that distracts from the shot.  Focus is maybe a little soft in places, but we can still see the texture of the thumbprints and the blood is pretty clear as well.  The negative space is good for the subject.  Helps balance the shot I think.  I like how the hand looks like a snake coiled up.  Odd observation maybe, but interesting non the less.  Don''t care for the subject matter, but like I said, technically ok.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Not a very attractive shot, but technically pretty well done I guess.  Lighting appears to be good.  The underside of the tack is a bit dark, but nothing that distracts from the shot.  Focus is maybe a little soft in places, but we can still see the texture of the thumbprints and the blood is pretty clear as well.  The negative space is good for the subject.  Helps balance the shot I think.  I like how the hand looks like a snake coiled up.  Odd observation maybe, but interesting non the less.  Don''t care for the subject matter, but like I said, technically ok.  ~Heather~', '2005-07-27 03:49:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1658789, 166954, 34571, '<td valign="top">beautiful! it looks so peacful and. by the way... i know absolutely nothing about sailing and even i know that tacks have something to do with it, although i could not tell you what.</td>', 'beautiful! it looks so peacful and. by the way... i know absolutely nothing about sailing and even i know that tacks have something to do with it, although i could not tell you what.', '2005-08-30 18:27:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1724802, 167023, 44565, '<td valign="top">Very <b>tack</b>tical photographing here. The green was an excellent choice of colour for this. I don''t think any other colour would have done quite as well. Kudos for that title too. I''m most fascinated by the way the water (Assuming that is your liquid of choice..) splashed up in the back, in a quasi-serpentine way. Congrats on 1st place.</td>', 'Very tacktical photographing here. The green was an excellent choice of colour for this. I don''t think any other colour would have done quite as well. Kudos for that title too. I''m most fascinated by the way the water (Assuming that is your liquid of choice..) splashed up in the back, in a quasi-serpentine way. Congrats on 1st place.', '2005-09-20 18:51:33.000000', NULL, 0),
