(2068274, 167023, 30896, '<td valign="top">great image, but another, less visible achievement was the score. It is exactly the same as a very very similar older photo by kiwiness<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=46396" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/158/thumb/46396.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/158/thumb/46396.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/158/thumb/46396.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=167023" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/331/thumb/167023.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/331/thumb/167023.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/331/thumb/167023.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Avg (all users): 7.498 both.<br/> <br/>I don''t mean you copied it (even if you did your picture still deserved the blue), I''m just perplexed by the coincidence :-o</td>', 'great image, but another, less visible achievement was the score. It is exactly the same as a very very similar older photo by kiwiness    Avg (all users): 7.498 both. I don''t mean you copied it (even if you did your picture still deserved the blue), I''m just perplexed by the coincidence :-o', '2006-01-21 16:36:15.000000', NULL, 0),
